<title>UK: London gold fixes at lowest in two months.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes at lowest in two months.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>London gold fixed at the lowest level since July 9, 1996 on Tuesday morning after a sell-off on Monday pushed prices below a key support level.</p>
<p>Bullion fixed at $382.45 an ounce, compared to $384.60 on Monday afternoon and $385.00 in the morning.</p>
